OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders  
OL,5,CToday:FAny overnight fog patches       
OL,6,Fclearing this morning. Otherwise it    
OL,7,Fwill be a dry day with variable        
OL,8,Famounts of cloud and some sunshine,    
OL,9,Fbest of the sunshine across the east.  
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry with 
OL,12,Fclear periods. Clouding over at times  
OL,13,Facross Lothian, Edinburgh and Borders  
OL,14,Fwith a few light showers. Dry with     
OL,15,Fpatchy frost elsewhere.                
OL,17,CSunday:FDry with variable amounts of   
OL,18,Fcloud and some sunny intervals. Fresh  
OL,19,Fto strong east or southeasterly winds  
OL,20,Falong the Solway coast.                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
